      "content": "<div class=\"mm-release-marker\" data-mm-release=\"f94027611ab71565c9dfd689046bb4a24db921b97ef1453416d5acfa140ed605\" data-mm-topic=\"t-mm-02-012\" hidden></div>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3016]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>6. TUBAL TEST</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>S</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong> AND </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>TUBAL </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>SURGERY</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='color: ##FFFFFF; font-family: \"Calibri Light\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong> </strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3017]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>Infertility </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>due to tubal factors </strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>17%</strong></em></span></p>\n<p class=\"mm-para\" data-mm-source-path=\"word/document.xml/w:document[1]/w:body[1]/w:p[3018]\"><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong>1 in</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong> 6</strong></em></span><span class=\"mm-run\" style='font-family: \"Calibri\", sans-serif; font-size: 16pt'><em><strong> couples</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"mm-table-scroll\" role=\"region\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"mm-table\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;margin-left:0pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;\"><colgroup><col style=\"width:121.55pt;\"><col style=\"width:101.7pt;\"><col style=\"width:142.2pt;\"><col style=\"width:102.05pt;\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-mm-row-height-twips=\"494\" data-mm-row-height-rule=\"auto\"><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;background-color:#D9E2F3;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Test and operating time</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;background-color:#D9E2F3;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Key Points</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;background-color:#D9E2F3;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Effectiveness</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;background-color:#D9E2F3;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Safety</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Laparoscopy</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">30 min time</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+002D\" data-source-marker-font=\"Calibri\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">-</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span></li></ul></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Unknown</p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Bowell/vascular injury 0.13%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Bladder injury</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>HSG</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">10min</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Sensitivity 53% - D 7 \u2013 12 of cycle</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Specificity 87%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- oil based: oil embolism &amp; granulomas formation</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- water base: Superior image Quality</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">unknown</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Anaphylaxis</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PiD 3.1%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Radiation exposure 2G</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>Saline \u2013 Sono hysteroscopy</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">12min</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- saline infusion sonography (sis) for cavity.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- hystero salpingo foam sonography for tubes.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- catchers 5F, 7F.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">unknown</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">PiD</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>SSTC</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">15min</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- Selective salpingography &amp; tubal catheterization.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- measures tubal perfusion pressure directly which has good prognostic value.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- Reduces false positive results due to tubal spasm.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- Pregnancy rate 30%.</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">- catheterization rate 62 \u2013 90%.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Tubal perforation 2%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Ectopic 3%</p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent:-18pt;\"><li data-source-marker-codepoints=\"U+F0F0\" data-source-marker-font=\"Wingdings\"><span class=\"list-prefix\" style=\"display:inline-flex;width:18pt;\"><span class=\"list-marker\">\u21e8</span><span class=\"list-tab\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-list-suffix=\"tab\" style=\"flex:1 1 auto;min-width:0;\"></span></span>THL</li></ul><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Transvaginal hydro laparoscopy</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">15 min</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Mini laparoscopy:</p><p style=\"margin:0;padding-left:36pt;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Under Local anesthesia</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Insertion of needle in POD &amp; insufflation of 0.4 \u2013 0.6%lit of fluid followed by small diameter rigid angle endoscopy &amp; visualization of Adnexa, pouch and tubes with dye test.</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;text-align:center;margin-bottom:8pt;\">unknown</p></td><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.9pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\"></p><p style=\"margin:0;margin-bottom:8pt;\">Bowel Injury, rectal 0.61%</p></td></tr><tr><td style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;width:134.85pt;border-top:0.5pt solid #000000;border-right:0.5pt solid #000000;border-bottom:0.5pt solid #000000;border-left:0.5pt solid #000000;padding-top:0pt;padding-right:5.4pt;padding-bottom:0pt;padding-left:5.4pt;\"><ul style=\"list-style-type:none;margin:0 0 0 36pt;padding:0;text-indent: